WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:05.000
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:15.500
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:30.970
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:34.930
I can’t believe it!

00:01:35.410 --> 00:01:38.420
‎THIS STORY IS A FICTION AND ALL NAMES OF FIGURES AND ORGANIZATIONS ARE FICTITIOUS.
MOREOVER, THE STORY HAS NO RELATION TO REAL-LIFE INCIDENTS AND EVENTS.

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:38.640
Serving anyone other than Lady Gyokuyou?!

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:40.850
Even if you say that…

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:42.480
There’s…

00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:46.400
There’s a ghost…

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:47.730
in the palace bathhouse!

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:54.740
Why not consult
Lord Jinshi about it first?

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:57.200
After hearing something like that,

00:01:57.280 --> 00:01:59.910
there’s no way I can just ignore it.

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:04.790
-Maomao.
-As expected.

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:07.670
The task has fallen to me.

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:09.420
You called for me?

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:12.310
Episode 38: The Dancing Ghost

00:02:16.930 --> 00:02:18.640
Damn.

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:20.930
I got an ox bezoar and completely forgot,

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:24.350
but during that last hunt,
I learned an outrageous secret.

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:26.400
All men in the rear palace,

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:29.360
aside from the Emperor, are eunuchs.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.360
However, Lord Jinshi is not.

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:34.110
He possesses a rather impressive frog.

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:40.160
So, what is your request today?

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:43.620
It seems that a ghost has been appearing
in a certain consort’s chambers.

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:47.580
Oh my, how dreadful.

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:51.130
Which consort is it?

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:52.960
I must go visit her.

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:54.380
Lady Gyokuyou,

00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:57.260
you mustn’t go outside in your condition.

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:59.260
In that case, I shall send someone.

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:01.470
You're right.

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:04.520
Hongniang, how about

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:06.350
you and Maomao go together?

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:10.190
Lady Gyokuyou,
this is a confidential matter,

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:12.190
so please refrain from visiting.

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:14.530
With that in mind,

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:17.200
may I have her back?

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:20.700
If you'd like to "borrow" her,
I’ll give her to you.

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:26.870
This exchange again?

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:30.290
No, I want you to "return" her.

00:03:31.090 --> 00:03:33.760
Return Maomao to me.

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:36.880
Once I'm done and give her to you,

00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:39.720
no matter what you ask her,

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:41.470
she won’t say a word.

00:03:42.390 --> 00:03:44.600
I’ll make sure of that.

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:49.270
Well, let’s be on our way.

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:02.370
You two…
Did something happen during the hunt?

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:05.580
It's because of a frog.

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:07.750
A frog?

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:11.630
Considering the secret
I have to take to my grave,

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:14.250
maybe the ox bezoar wasn't worth it.

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:17.010
We've been expecting you.

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:28.940
Just how much does Lord Gaoshun know?

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:33.400
Or perhaps, he is also not a eunuch?

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:37.400
Never mind.
Thinking about it won’t change anything.

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:43.410
Good day, Lady Lishu.

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:45.370
Lord Jinshi!

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:46.740
Could you guide us to

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:50.120
the bathhouse where the ghost was seen?

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:52.580
Yes.

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:55.500
Aren't they being a little too obvious?

00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:59.220
For a high-ranking consort,
this is quite concerning.

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:01.050
This way.

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:07.020
The changing room is in the front,
and the bath is in the back.

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:11.640
But Lady Lishu saw the strange shadow

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:13.980
from this storage room window.

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:17.070
What kind of shadow did you see?

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:19.150
W-Well…

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:23.070
Are you still going on about that?

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:25.700
It must have been a trick of the light.

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:29.950
Lady Lishu just wants attention.

00:05:32.420 --> 00:05:36.840
Making such a fuss over something trivial.

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:38.300
It is

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:42.720
a head lady-in-waiting’s duty
to correct such behavior.

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:45.180
Or do former food tasters

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:47.970
not even understand that?

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:49.470
My apologies.

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:51.480
Judging by her tone,

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:54.560
that arrogant attendant
must be the former head lady-in-waiting.

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:57.230
Losing her position to the food taster

00:05:57.320 --> 00:06:00.690
must have left her bitter enough
to spew sarcasm daily.

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:05.320
That hairpin…?

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:08.330
Don’t you agree?

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:10.660
Perhaps.

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:15.540
However, listening to the consorts
is also my duty.

00:06:15.630 --> 00:06:18.000
Could you refrain from taking over my job?

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:20.420
Understood.

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:25.130
I feel a bit thirsty.

00:06:26.430 --> 00:06:28.100
I’ll bring tea at once!

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:30.470
-I will!
-No, let me!

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:32.230
Let me!

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:34.520
Now then, Lady Lishu,

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:36.310
please tell me in detail.

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:39.820
Y… Yes.

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:44.570
He sent everyone away to make sure
Lady Lishu doesn’t shrink back.

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:49.830
It happened after my usual bath.

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:53.000
I actually prefer lukewarm water,

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:55.830
but the maids always prepare hot baths,

00:06:56.670 --> 00:07:00.210
so I make it a habit to bathe
a little later when the water cools.

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:03.090
I kind of knew,

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:05.930
but the maids

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:08.550
don’t seem too fond of me.

00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:12.810
Since my time in the nunnery,
I’ve always bathed alone.

00:07:13.350 --> 00:07:16.230
Only Kanan, I mean…

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:19.060
the head lady-in-waiting,
helped me with my clothes.

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:21.360
When I was wiping myself dry,

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:24.280
I felt hot, so I lifted the blinds.

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:28.280
Even though the window was shut,

00:07:28.360 --> 00:07:30.240
the curtain swayed.

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:34.040
And there, grinning, was a white face…

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:35.870
dancing.

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:40.040
While staring… right at me.

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:47.760
Could there have been someone nearby?

00:07:49.140 --> 00:07:51.890
No. Kanan was the only one close by.

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:54.560
She saw the same ghost too!

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:58.600
When I tried to get closer to identify it…

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:01.400
The ghost vanished,

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:06.440
and the curtain suddenly stopped moving.

00:08:07.610 --> 00:08:11.620
The windows leading outside were all shut,

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:13.780
so there was no wind.

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:16.700
And yet, the curtain swayed.

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:21.210
No wonder they were frightened
and believed it was a ghost.

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:24.250
But this layout is odd.

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:26.420
In the Crystal and Jade Pavilion,

00:08:26.510 --> 00:08:28.510
the bathhouses are separate structures

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:30.720
with lounging areas.

00:08:31.590 --> 00:08:35.260
Who builds a storage room
next to a bathhouse?

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:41.440
Was that room originally a storage room?

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:44.360
No, it wasn't…

00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:48.320
-Then why did they turn it into storage?
-That's because…

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:55.870
If you look here, you’ll understand.

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.210
I see.

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:05.960
It’s covered in mold.

00:09:06.590 --> 00:09:08.300
The maids of the Jade Pavilion

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:09.920
would have investigated

00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:12.470
and prevented mold from forming,

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:16.140
but expecting that the maids here
would do the same is unrealistic.

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:19.520
In the end, they turned it into
a storage room to cover it up.

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:28.610
It's possible that the foundation
itself might be rotting.

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:31.780
Is this building older than the others?

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:34.820
No, it’s actually newer.

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:37.660
It was built when Lady Lishu
entered the palace.

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:39.790
It’s in this state after just a few years?

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:43.750
Lady Lishu mentioned the curtain moving.

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:48.380
Show me the bath.

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:53.050
There it is.

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:55.220
This hole should lead

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:58.060
to the waterway of the rear palace.

00:09:58.810 --> 00:10:00.060
-Lady Lishu.
-Oh?

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:02.520
On the day the ghost appeared,

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:05.480
did you, by any chance,
accidentally drain the bathwater?

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:08.190
How did you know?

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:09.690
I knew it!

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:11.860
Sealed windows,

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:13.900
swaying curtains,

00:10:13.990 --> 00:10:16.780
and a drained bathtub.

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:19.580
If my deduction is correct,

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:21.910
the dancing ghost is…

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:30.670
Lord Gaoshun,

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:33.720
could you help me move this shelf?

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:34.930
Certainly.

00:10:39.390 --> 00:10:41.020
This is terrible.

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:43.430
Yes, it's rotting badly.

00:10:45.350 --> 00:10:47.730
The floor is warped and creating gaps.

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:50.020
That would mean…

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:53.490
Could we check if there's
a water channel beneath here?

00:10:53.570 --> 00:10:56.490
I'll prepare the architectural plans
immediately.

00:10:58.490 --> 00:11:01.290
-Here they are.
-Thank you.

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:06.790
As I suspected, there’s
a water channel beneath this floor.

00:11:07.460 --> 00:11:09.210
If hot water flows under here,

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:12.300
the steam would cause the floor
and walls to rot more easily.

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:13.550
And the steam

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:17.090
rising through these gaps
would create airflow,

00:11:17.180 --> 00:11:18.800
making the curtains sway.

00:11:20.300 --> 00:11:23.680
Then… what was that face I saw?

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:27.230
Ah, that.

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:33.280
Um, that is…

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:35.860
That mirror is

00:11:35.950 --> 00:11:39.030
important to me.
Please handle it with care.

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:42.660
Understood. How long has this been here?

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:45.160
I used to use it often.

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:48.250
But now I have the mirror
that was sent by the envoy.

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:51.250
The envoy’s mirror is made of glass

00:11:51.340 --> 00:11:53.590
and reflects far better
than a bronze mirror.

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:57.170
It’s understandable that
she put her old mirror away. Even so…

00:11:57.680 --> 00:11:59.840
Do you polish this every day?

00:12:00.970 --> 00:12:03.720
Yes, it was my mother’s.

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:09.190
At a glance,
it looks like an ordinary bronze mirror…

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:12.190
Lady Lishu,

00:12:12.270 --> 00:12:15.400
since we have the mirror here,
how about using it again?

00:12:16.740 --> 00:12:17.740
Please, go ahead.

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:22.910
Use it…?

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:27.750
It’s easier to see
if you use it in a bright spot.

00:12:33.170 --> 00:12:36.260
If you angle it this way,
you might get a clearer reflection.

00:12:45.140 --> 00:12:47.980
I see, so that’s how it appears.

00:12:48.060 --> 00:12:49.520
What does this mean?

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:51.810
It’s called a "magic mirror."

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:54.230
This is my first time seeing a real one.

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:55.230
A magic mirror?

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:58.030
It’s also known as
a "transmission mirror."

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:00.610
When light bounces off it,

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:02.740
it mysteriously forms images or text.

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:05.990
The technique involves engraving patterns
into the mirror’s surface

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:08.160
during its creation.

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:10.580
It requires considerable craftsmanship,

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:12.790
something my foster father once told me.

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:20.090
A polished mirror catches the moonlight,

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:21.180
reflecting a face.

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:23.680
Steam rises through the gaps,

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:25.640
making the curtain sway.

00:13:27.310 --> 00:13:31.100
In conclusion, a series of coincidences

00:13:31.190 --> 00:13:33.190
created this "ghost."

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:38.400
That face… It looks like my late mother.

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:40.950
Maybe she was angry

00:13:41.030 --> 00:13:44.820
because I stopped using her mirror.

00:13:45.370 --> 00:13:47.200
Maybe that’s why she appeared.

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:49.950
It was just a coincidence.

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:53.000
I heard that she loved to dance.

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:56.790
But after giving birth to me,
she fell ill and could no longer dance.

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:59.170
And then she passed away.

00:13:59.260 --> 00:14:02.050
Maybe she became a ghost
so she could dance again.

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:04.390
Ghosts don't--

00:14:13.940 --> 00:14:15.650
At her age,

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:18.150
she should be able to
enjoy life more freely.

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:21.030
But polishing her mother’s mirror
every day

00:14:21.110 --> 00:14:24.450
might have been her way
of finding solace in the palace.

00:14:25.610 --> 00:14:28.660
I don’t understand
what it’s like to long for one’s mother.

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:32.200
But to Lady Lishu,

00:14:32.290 --> 00:14:35.000
her mother must have been someone
worth cherishing.

00:14:38.590 --> 00:14:40.750
I hope he likes it.

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:42.260
Pardon the interruption.

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:45.130
We've prepared tea outside.

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:53.730
Lady Lishu, why are you crying?

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:56.100
It’s improper to show such emotion
in front of everyone.

00:14:56.770 --> 00:15:00.480
She speaks as if she’s a devoted maid,

00:15:00.570 --> 00:15:03.280
but her true nature seeps through.

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:05.150
Such an obvious act.

00:15:05.240 --> 00:15:07.660
Oh my, that mirror?

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:10.530
You still have it?

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:14.910
The envoy gifted you a far superior one,

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:16.750
so you don’t need this anymore.

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:20.000
-Why not bestow it upon someone else?
-Give it…

00:15:20.090 --> 00:15:21.710
Pardon?

00:15:22.420 --> 00:15:26.220
Give it back! Give it back!

00:15:28.890 --> 00:15:29.720
What is wrong with you!

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:33.100
Such disgraceful behavior
in front of guests!

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:36.350
That is something very precious
to Lady Lishu.

00:15:36.980 --> 00:15:40.610
Taking it without proper consideration
seems inappropriate.

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:52.990
Was this item bestowed upon you?

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:57.920
Even if it was,

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:00.170
for a mere maid to wear an ornament

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:02.340
bearing the crest
of a high-ranking consort…

00:16:04.210 --> 00:16:06.800
did you not find that inappropriate?

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:13.760
Lord Jinshi must have
known that Lady Lishu

00:16:13.850 --> 00:16:15.680
was being disregarded by her maids.

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:18.310
He kept quiet

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:20.810
to preserve her dignity.

00:16:21.610 --> 00:16:25.400
But with physical evidence,
he can finally put them in their place.

00:16:26.780 --> 00:16:31.160
From now on, refrain from actions
that exceed your position.

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:45.050
He's terrifying.

00:16:49.760 --> 00:16:52.180
-Isn't that him?
-So charming!

00:16:52.260 --> 00:16:55.060
Here to peek at the newcomers again?

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:59.690
Yeah, yeah. I get it, Maomao.

00:17:01.100 --> 00:17:05.230
Young lady, are you researching more
anesthetic-like medicines again?

00:17:05.320 --> 00:17:06.230
Yes.

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:10.110
They don’t make new eunuchs anymore,
so there’s no need to investigate that.

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:14.580
By the way,
how do eunuchs enter the rear palace?

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:16.620
Through surgery.

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:17.830
No, I mean,

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:20.830
how do they prove they’re eunuchs?

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:24.750
In the past, a certificate was enough,

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:26.800
but due to fraud,

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:29.470
now they undergo a physical examination.

00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:30.920
They grab it?

00:17:31.010 --> 00:17:33.390
You’re too blunt, young lady!

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:35.510
To prevent fraud,

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:38.720
three officials from different departments
conduct the examination,

00:17:38.810 --> 00:17:40.640
and if nothing is there,
they’re allowed in.

00:17:40.730 --> 00:17:42.690
Are they only checked one time?

00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:45.360
They check every time they enter and exit.

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:47.270
Only the Emperor

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:50.820
and his blood relatives can enter
the rear palace without being eunuchs.

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:53.740
Does that mean Lord Jinshi is…

00:17:53.820 --> 00:17:55.870
No, that can’t be.

00:17:56.450 --> 00:17:57.620
Speaking of eunuchs,

00:17:57.700 --> 00:18:00.540
have you heard about the new recruits?

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:04.670
Xiaolan and Shisui mentioned it.

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:08.710
I've heard rumors,
about 30 of them entered, right?

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:10.420
Exactly!

00:18:10.510 --> 00:18:14.220
Many of them are young and good-looking,
so everyone's excited!

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:17.140
The other day,
one of them got tangled up with

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:20.680
a lower-ranked consort while preparing
the bath. It was quite the scene!

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:23.190
He actually went to check them out?

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:25.940
When exactly do you plan to tell her?

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:27.900
Eventually.

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:31.780
Your attitude is
so obvious, it's unnatural.

00:18:32.280 --> 00:18:35.780
Even Maomao looked at you
like you were a dried-up worm.

00:18:37.240 --> 00:18:39.160
Shut up. I know.

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:43.830
If you don’t decide soon,
things will get messy.

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:47.210
You want me to bring her over
to our side immediately, right?

00:18:47.290 --> 00:18:50.000
But the strategist will intervene.

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:52.550
Fight poison with poison.

00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:56.640
Dai Kan Lakan.

00:18:56.720 --> 00:18:59.850
A man who took his family’s estate from
his biological father and half-brother

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:01.720
years ago,
becoming the head of the Luo clan.

00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:04.980
Even the emperor acknowledges him.

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:07.940
Despite holding the rank
of Grand Commandant,

00:19:08.020 --> 00:19:11.570
he remains unaffiliated with any faction,
deftly avoiding entanglements.

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:14.780
Many have tried to strike him down,

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:18.740
but those who dared
suffered far worse than just burns.

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:22.080
No one understands

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:24.000
what goes on inside his head.

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:26.080
The unspoken rule in court

00:19:26.170 --> 00:19:29.080
is to avoid him.

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:33.050
But if I plan to bring Maomao in,

00:19:33.130 --> 00:19:35.010
I can’t ignore this.

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:38.010
I want to tell her the truth.

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:40.010
Why I hold this position,

00:19:40.100 --> 00:19:42.600
and why I hide my true identity.

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:44.100
I want her to know.

00:19:44.730 --> 00:19:47.270
But after that, how will she react?

00:19:51.320 --> 00:19:54.780
Another rear palace complaint?
Why so many?

00:19:55.530 --> 00:19:58.740
Half of them are concerning
Consort Loulan.

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:00.450
They say that
she has too many palace women,

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:03.870
her excessive use of elaborate outfits
is ruining the rear palace's aesthetics,

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:05.370
and so on.

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:07.330
Same complaints as always.

00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:10.960
This one is new, though.

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:17.130
"Palace women are
flirting with the new eunuch."

00:20:17.970 --> 00:20:19.930
I could’ve guessed.

00:20:20.010 --> 00:20:23.260
Yes, we’ve assigned them
to physical labor for now.

00:20:23.850 --> 00:20:27.480
We’ll eventually transfer them to
suitable departments based on aptitude,

00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:30.520
but they were originally slaves
captured by foreign tribes.

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:32.770
We need to be cautious.

00:20:34.320 --> 00:20:37.780
I suppose we should take a look
at least for formality’s sake.

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:39.240
Yes.

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:42.410
-What a hassle.
-Let's just do it.

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:46.620
The ones with white sashes
are the new eunuchs.

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:50.000
They’re thin and seem nervous.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:53.710
Even after gaining freedom,

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:57.380
former slaves struggle
to live like ordinary citizens.

00:20:57.460 --> 00:21:01.050
In some ways,
the rear palace is a suitable refuge.

00:21:05.470 --> 00:21:06.930
So that’s the infamous new eunuch, huh?

00:21:07.560 --> 00:21:09.850
What happened to his left arm?

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:11.900
He was severely beaten,

00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:14.900
leaving his left side partially numb.

00:21:15.400 --> 00:21:18.740
His body is covered in scars,
and he refuses to show his skin.

00:21:18.820 --> 00:21:19.740
I see.

00:21:21.610 --> 00:21:23.910
He’s quite popular, though.

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:26.290
Yes, he’s smart

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:28.580
and knows how to handle
the palace women well.

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:33.790
-What?
-Like you can talk.

00:21:43.140 --> 00:21:46.390
-How are the new recruits?
-Lord Jinshi!

00:21:50.560 --> 00:21:52.270
They must still be adjusting, but in time,

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:55.730
they’ll be assigned appropriate duties.
Be patient.

00:21:58.980 --> 00:22:02.280
What do we do?! That was ice

00:22:02.360 --> 00:22:04.410
meant for a high-ranking consort!

00:22:06.280 --> 00:22:09.490
Damn it! I’m done for!

00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:14.330
I’m so sorry…

00:23:46.000 --> 00:24:00.930
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:57.250 --> 00:24:00.930
Next episode: Ice

00:24:00.140 --> 00:24:00.930
